<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it raised its 1997 earnings estimate on Sun Microsystems Inc to $1.86 a share from $1.73 a share.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1998 earnings estimate to $2.22 a share from $2.07 a share.</p>
<p>-- said reiterates buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Sun Microsystems lost 1-3/4 to 27-5/8.</p>
</text>
